          <row>
            <cell>ⓐ We start with 2 positives.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>We need to take away 8 positives, but we have only 2.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Add neutral pairs until there are 8 positives to take away.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Then take away eight positives.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Find the number of counters that are left.There are 6 negatives.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
