          <row>
            <cell>ⓑ We start with 3 negatives.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>We need to take away 8 negatives, but we have only 3.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Add neutral pairs until there are 8 negatives to take away.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Then take away the 8 negatives.</cell>
            <cell/>
