            <cell/>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Translate.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>Simplify.</cell>
            <cell/>
          </row>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <paragraph>ⓑ Subtract means to take $$24$$ away from $$-19.$$</paragraph>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <cell/>
            <cell/>
          </row>
